<title>UK: East Japan Railway sets $800 mln 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>East Japan Railway sets $800 mln 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IBJ International and Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EAST JAPAN RAILWAY CO</p>
<p> AMT    $800 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    11.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    11.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35 PCT  REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+39 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS UK/US/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15 PCT  SELL CONC  0.20 PCT  PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
